#, no-wrap
msgid "The `solutions` field in the return dictionary contains all degenerate best solutions found, as dictionaries that map each variable name to its assignment. The same solutions are also returned as bitstrings in `solution_bitstrings`; `metadata.solver_info.variable_mapping` tells you which character position of a bitstring belongs to which variable. Alongside the solution data, the `objective_value`, a `feasible` flag, and additional `metadata` are provided.\n"
